     2985   on f5 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere
     2986   do:
     2987     v-doc-rec = recid(X_c-fin-schet). run OpenBr in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U). reposition br-schet to recid v-doc-rec no-error. v-doc-rec = ?.               apply 'value-changed' to br-schet.
     2988       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to BR-changes.
     2989   end.
